## Main Agent vs Subagents

| Aspect | Main Agent | Subagent |
|---|---|---|
| **Role** | Conversational AI, task coordinator | Specialized worker for focused tasks |
| **Launch** | Always present in chat | Launched via `Task` tool |
| **Autonomy** | Full tool access | Depends on subagent_type |
| **Parallelism** | Sequential (one at a time) | Can run multiple in parallel |
| **Background** | N/A | `run_in_background: true` supported |
| **Resumability** | N/A | `resume: <agent-id>` supported |
| **Forking** | N/A | `resume: "self"` supported |

